            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Darrell Drake"
            },
            "reviewBody": "LOVE the ingredient choices, not so hot on the outdoor grill idea. For normal folk like me, just tossing it on a small cookie sheet the oven for 20 min or so did the trick just fine.",
